    "text": "abcnews4.com\nwebsite\nSouth Carolina\nFDA warns of shrimp from Indonesia, local shrimpers highlight foreign shrimp risk\nBy Emily Deanne,\n1 days agoLOWCOUNTY, S.C. (WCIV) — The U.S. Food and Drug Administration has issued a warning regarding certain frozen shrimp imported from Indonesia distributed under the Great Value brand and sold at Walmart. South Carolina shrimpers say the find underscores the need for oversight on imported foods. The concern stems from...\n91",
